      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rossmoor%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The original plan called for five interconnected villages with shopping, hospitals, and recreation, but only Village One was built.",
